    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“Metal remembers how it died. You teach it better endings.”</em></p><p>After you finish a Soma Break, you can choose one weapon you have personally <strong>forged, repaired, or significantly modified</strong> during this adventure.</p><ul><li>For the next <strong>hour</strong>, that weapon deals an extra <strong>+1 damage</strong> on each hit.</li><li>The extra damage is the same type as the weapon’s normal damage.</li><li>You can have only one weapon under this effect at a time. Starting Echo Temper again ends the previous echo.</li></ul>",
